msgctxt "table.gStatDesc.0"
msgid ""
"{Attack Skill}\n"
"\n"
"Your attack skill is a bonus added to each creature's attack skill."
msgstr ""
"{Атака}\n"
"\n"
"Ваш навык атаки - бонус, добавляемый к навыку атаки каждого воина."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
