msgid "Suddenly, a biting coldness engulfs your body.  You seize up, falling from your horse.  The pain subsides, but you still feel as if your chest is frozen.  As you pick yourself up off of the ground, you hear hearty laughter.  You turn around just in time to see a Frost Giant run off into the woods and disappear."
msgstr "Suddenly, a biting coldness engulfs your body.  You seize up, falling from your horse.  The pain subsides, but you still feel as if your chest is frozen.  As you pick yourself up off of the ground, you hear hearty laughter.  You turn around just in time to see a Frost Giant run off into the woods and disappear."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.94"
msgid "You spy a gleaming object poking up out of the ground.   You send a member of your party over to investigate.  He comes back with a golden helmet in his hands.  You realize that it must be the helmet of the legendary Anduran, the only man who was known to wear solid gold armor."
msgstr "You spy a gleaming object poking up out of the ground.   You send a member of your party over to investigate.  He comes back with a golden helmet in his hands.  You realize that it must be the helmet of the legendary Anduran, the only man who was known to wear solid gold armor."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.95"
msgid "You come upon a battle where a Paladin has been mortally wounded by a group of Zombies.  He asks you to take his hammer and finish what he started.  As you pick it up, it begins to hum, and then everything becomes a blur.  The Zombies lie dead, the hammer dripping with blood.  You strap it to your belt."
msgstr "You come upon a battle where a Paladin has been mortally wounded by a group of Zombies.  He asks you to take his hammer and finish what he started.  As you pick it up, it begins to hum, and then everything becomes a blur.  The Zombies lie dead, the hammer dripping with blood.  You strap it to your belt."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.96"
msgid "Upon cresting a small hill, you come upon a ridiculous looking sight.  A Sprite is attempting to carry a Scepter that is almost as big as it is.  Trying not to laugh, you ask, \"Need help?\"  The Sprite glares at you and answers: \"You think this is funny?  Fine.  You can carry it.  I much prefer flying anyway.\""
msgstr "Upon cresting a small hill, you come upon a ridiculous looking sight.  A Sprite is attempting to carry a Scepter that is almost as big as it is.  Trying not to laugh, you ask, \"Need help?\"  The Sprite glares at you and answers: \"You think this is funny?  Fine.  You can carry it.  I much prefer flying anyway.\""

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.97"
msgid "An old seaman tells you a tale of an enchanted masthead that he used in his youth to rally his crew during times of trouble.  He then hands you a faded map that shows where he hid it.  After much exploring, you find it stashed underneath a nearby dock."
msgstr "An old seaman tells you a tale of an enchanted masthead that he used in his youth to rally his crew during times of trouble.  He then hands you a faded map that shows where he hid it.  After much exploring, you find it stashed underneath a nearby dock."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.98"
msgid "You stop to help a Peasant catch a runaway mare.  To show his gratitude, he hands you a tiny sphere.  As soon as you grasp it, you feel the magical energy drain from your limbs..."
msgstr "You stop to help a Peasant catch a runaway mare.  To show his gratitude, he hands you a tiny sphere.  As soon as you grasp it, you feel the magical energy drain from your limbs..."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.99"
msgid "While out scaring up game, your troops find a mysterious staff levitating about three feet off of the ground.  They hand it to you, and you notice an inscription.  It reads: \"Brains best brawn and magic beats might.  Heed my words, and you'll win every fight.\""
msgstr "While out scaring up game, your troops find a mysterious staff levitating about three feet off of the ground.  They hand it to you, and you notice an inscription.  It reads: \"Brains best brawn and magic beats might.  Heed my words, and you'll win every fight.\""

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.100"
msgid "A former Captain of the Guard admires your quest and gives you the enchanted Sword Breaker that he relied on during his tour of duty."
msgstr "A former Captain of the Guard admires your quest and gives you the enchanted Sword Breaker that he relied on during his tour of duty."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.101"
msgid "A Troll stops you and says: \"Pay me 5,000 gold, or the Sword of Anduran will slay you where you stand.\"  You refuse.  The troll grabs the sword hanging from its belt, screams in pain, and runs away.  Picking up the fabled sword, you give thanks that half-witted Trolls tend to grab the wrong end of sharp objects."
msgstr "A Troll stops you and says: \"Pay me 5,000 gold, or the Sword of Anduran will slay you where you stand.\"  You refuse.  The troll grabs the sword hanging from its belt, screams in pain, and runs away.  Picking up the fabled sword, you give thanks that half-witted Trolls tend to grab the wrong end of sharp objects."

#. Legacy table entry; English is authoritative in the C++ initializer.
#: src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgctxt "table.gArtifactEvent.102"
msgid "A dirty shovel has been thrust into a dirt mound nearby. Upon investigation, you discover it to be the enchanted shovel of the Gravediggers, long thought lost by mortals."
msgstr "A dirty shovel has been thrust into a dirt mound nearby. Upon investigation, you discover it to be the enchanted shovel of the Gravediggers, long thought lost by mortals."

